@startuml
title Component-and-Connector view with layered overlay — progetto_ing_software_gr10-main-English
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam wrapWidth 420
component "Presentation\n--\n- HomePageGUI: application entry point (main) that shows the home\n  page and opens the registration and login windows\n- UserLoginGUI: collects login credentials and hands them to\n  UserLoginController\n- UserRegistrationGUI: collects registration data and submits it\n  through SystemServicesController\n- UserDashboardGUI: role-dependent dashboard that opens the report\n  creation, review and monitoring windows\n- ReportCreationGUI: form where a citizen creates a report\n- SubmittedReportsGUI: lists the reports a citizen submitted and\n  shows their details\n- ReceivedReportsGUI: lists the received reports for an operator,\n  with filters, and opens the note and status-update windows\n- ReportStatusUpdateGUI: lets an operator advance the status of a\n  report\n- InternalNoteGUI: lets an operator add an internal note to a\n  report\n- ActivityMonitoringGUI: lets an operator request activity-trend\n  monitoring results" as e_group_layer_presentation_67387e <<presentation>>
component "Application\n--\n- SystemServicesController: facade giving the boundary one entry\n  point; delegates each use case to its use-case controller\n- UserLoginController: validates login data and obtains the user\n  session data from UserService\n- UserRegistrationController: validates registration data and\n  rejects an already registered email before registering the user\n- ReportCreationController: validates report data, checks the user\n  is a citizen and requests report registration\n- ReportReviewController: checks the user role and retrieves\n  submitted (citizen) or received (operator) reports\n- ReportDetailsController: checks access to a report (operator or\n  owning citizen) and retrieves its details and history\n- ReportStatusUpdateController: checks operator privileges,\n  advances the report status and then requests the notification\n- InternalNoteController: checks operator permission and requests\n  registration of an internal note\n- ActivityMonitoringController: authorises the operator, validates\n  criteria and requests monitoring results\n- NotificationController: decides whether a status is notifiable\n  and requests the citizen notification" as e_group_layer_application_01b64b <<application>>
component "Domain\n--\n- ReportService: domain service for reports: registers reports,\n  retrieves them, updates status, adds notes, generates\n  notifications and monitoring statistics\n- UserService: domain service for users: registers users, looks up\n  credentials and checks citizen/operator roles\n- Report: persistent report: data, location, assigned operator,\n  internal notes, status updates and a status object that drives\n  status changes\n- User: abstract persistent user with name, phone number and\n  credentials (single-table inheritance)\n- Citizen: user who submits reports\n- MunicipalOperator: user who reviews, updates and annotates\n  reports\n- InternalNote: persistent internal note written by an operator on\n  a report\n- StatusUpdate: persistent record of a status change made by an\n  operator\n- Notification: persistent notification sent to a citizen about a\n  report status change\n- ReportCategory: enumerates the categories a report can have\n- ReportStatus: state interface: advances a report and tells\n  whether the status is notifiable\n- Submitted: initial state; advancing makes the report Assigned\n- Assigned: state; advancing makes the report InProgress;\n  notifiable\n- InProgress: state; advancing makes the report Resolved\n- Resolved: final state; refuses further advancement; notifiable" as e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd <<domain>>
component "Persistence\n--\n- PersistenceService: generic persistence operations (save,\n  update, findById, findByAttribute, findByFields) run in\n  transactions\n- JpaUtil: singleton that owns the EntityManagerFactory of the\n  persistence unit and creates EntityManagers" as e_group_layer_persistence_7fe3c4 <<persistence>>
database "reports_db\n--\n- MySQL database that stores users, reports, internal notes,\n  status updates and notifications" as e_datastore_reports_db_9a8f5d <<MySQL>>
e_group_layer_presentation_67387e --> e_group_layer_application_01b64b : 8 dependencies
e_group_layer_presentation_67387e --> e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd : 2 dependencies (skips a layer)
e_group_layer_application_01b64b --> e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd : 16 dependencies
e_group_layer_domain_0f45bd --> e_group_layer_persistence_7fe3c4 : 2 dependencies
e_group_layer_persistence_7fe3c4 --> e_datastore_reports_db_9a8f5d : JDBC (MySQL) via JPA
@enduml
